    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Edition</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcbf <strong>DASHBOARD LOGIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Premium Server Access, Web Dashboard Login, and Weekly PixBuckz Rewards with the Steam DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/a537b1a009a456b64aac08bf6a2fa06f.poster.avif?t=1755768225\" width=800 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/a537b1a009a456b64aac08bf6a2fa06f.webm?t=1755768225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/a537b1a009a456b64aac08bf6a2fa06f.mp4?t=1755768225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Weekly Free PixBuckz for Steam Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Log in every week to claim free PixBuckz and redeem real-world rewards via our exclusive marketplace!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Global Leaderboards Now Live!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to the top and prove you're the fastest in the underground. Updated in real time for all Steam players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>REDEEM POINTS ON MARKET PLACE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/c3bf916918598d3dfb7b760a1a51a260.poster.avif?t=1755768225\" width=800 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/c3bf916918598d3dfb7b760a1a51a260.webm?t=1755768225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/c3bf916918598d3dfb7b760a1a51a260.mp4?t=1755768225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udcbf <strong>Request a Collector\u2019s Edition DVD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam users can request a physical DVD edition \u2014 a retro collectible for die-hard fans. Limited time only!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Steam Controller &amp; Steam Deck Optimized</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full gamepad support out of the box \u2014 tuned for Steam Deck and living room play.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/763855f1621650b21fc6bf105b1fb5dc.avif?t=1755768225\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f <strong>The Road to Lux\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amal and Lux were inseparable\u2014until a ruthless underground syndicate tore them apart. Lux was taken by four elite racers who rule the streets, each hiding her behind a wall of rubber, steel, and smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rescue her, Amal must rise through the ranks of the <strong>underground drag racing</strong> world, face the champions, and conquer the strip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rival has a unique <strong>driving style</strong>, intense backstory, and powerful machine. Win the races, master your <strong>inventory of parts</strong>, and uncover the truth in this <strong>retro pixel racer</strong> packed with heart and horsepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/7e0828a3931a108abe429bea3797956e.poster.avif?t=1755768225\" width=784 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/7e0828a3931a108abe429bea3797956e.webm?t=1755768225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/7e0828a3931a108abe429bea3797956e.mp4?t=1755768225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/a13636a85301274cea28f01319a8b1da.avif?t=1755768225\" width=800 height=112 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Customize. Race. Upgrade. Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a garage of <strong>pixel-perfect cars</strong> \u2014 from street beasts to tuned monsters. <strong>Customize every detail</strong> of your ride: upgrade engines, equip turbos, swap wraps, apply spoilers, and more. Every choice impacts your <strong>drag performance</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Full Controller Support</strong> \u2013 Built for gamepads &amp; keyboards<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Paint Shop</strong> \u2013 Style your ride with colors and themes<br>\u26fd <strong>Fuel Station</strong> \u2013 Manage your fuel for every run<br>\ud83d\udca6 <strong>Car Wash</strong> \u2013 Keep your machine show-ready<br>\ud83d\udea7 <strong>Garage Customization</strong> \u2013 Spoilers, wraps, bumpers, wheels, stickers<br>\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Inventory Management</strong> \u2013 Track every upgrade and owned part<br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Sticker Shop</strong> \u2013 Personalize your build<br>\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Dynamic Drag Battles</strong> \u2013 Reflex-based, manual shifting showdowns<br>\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Retro Racing Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Pixel graphics, neon nights, arcade energy</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Garage Customization</strong>: Modify parts like spoilers, wraps, and wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Inventory System</strong>: View and equip your purchased upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Drag Simulator Mechanics</strong>: Fuel usage, manual gear shifts, launch timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Story-Rich Campaign</strong>: Defeat 4 champions to unlock the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Accessible Yet Deep</strong>: Perfect for <strong>casual</strong> players and <strong>simulation</strong> fans alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Retro Racing &amp; Driving</strong> gameplay with <strong>modern twists</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/6585695fe782d4cace8c29df8f7b5e7c.avif?t=1755768225\" data-has-big width=800 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270d\ufe0f <strong>B</strong>est support from PixelTorque team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u00a0 </i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>\u00a0<strong>Ticket</strong>-\u00a0 .PixelTorque site then click support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for checking out our game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a passionate indie team pouring heart and soul into this project, and your support means the world to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the game to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> to stay updated, and join us on this journey as we continue to develop, improve, and bring our vision to life.<br><br>\ud83d\udccc Wishlist Now</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PixelTorque</strong> is a passion-fueled indie project built for lovers of <strong>drag racing</strong>, <strong>custom cars</strong>, and retro vibes.<br>Join Amal on his high-speed mission. <strong>Wishlist now</strong> and become part of the resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See you in the game!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/763855f1621650b21fc6bf105b1fb5dc.avif?t=1755768225\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f <strong>The Road to Lux\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amal and Lux were inseparable\u2014until a ruthless underground syndicate tore them apart. Lux was taken by four elite racers who rule the streets, each hiding her behind a wall of rubber, steel, and smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rescue her, Amal must rise through the ranks of the <strong>underground drag racing</strong> world, face the champions, and conquer the strip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rival has a unique <strong>driving style</strong>, intense backstory, and powerful machine. Win the races, master your <strong>inventory of parts</strong>, and uncover the truth in this <strong>retro pixel racer</strong> packed with heart and horsepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/7e0828a3931a108abe429bea3797956e.poster.avif?t=1755768225\" width=784 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/7e0828a3931a108abe429bea3797956e.webm?t=1755768225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/7e0828a3931a108abe429bea3797956e.mp4?t=1755768225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/a13636a85301274cea28f01319a8b1da.avif?t=1755768225\" width=800 height=112 /></span></h2><h2 class=\