rong> players and <strong>simulation</strong> fans alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Retro Racing &amp; Driving</strong> gameplay with <strong>modern twists</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/6585695fe782d4cace8c29df8f7b5e7c.avif?t=1755768225\" data-has-big width=800 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270d\ufe0f <strong>B</strong>est support from PixelTorque team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u00a0 </i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>\u00a0<strong>Ticket</strong>-\u00a0 .PixelTorque site then click support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for checking out our game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a passionate indie team pouring heart and soul into this project, and your support means the world to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the game to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> to stay updated, and join us on this journey as we continue to develop, improve, and bring our vision to life.<br><br>\ud83d\udccc Wishlist Now</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PixelTorque</strong> is a passion-fueled indie project built for lovers of <strong>drag racing</strong>, <strong>custom cars</strong>, and retro vibes.<br>Join Amal on his high-speed mission. <strong>Wishlist now</strong> and become part of the resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See you in the game!</strong></p>",
